    "title": "Sharks rally past Blues on Darnell Nurse's OT goal | Sports | lufkindailynews.com",
    "text": "Darnell Nurse scored 1:03 into overtime to give the San Jose Sharks a 3-2 road win over the St. Louis Blues on Thursday.\nSan Jose twice equalized in regulation, and Nurse's seventh career overtime winner sealed the comeback victory. Nurse left the bench and moved into the Blues' zone just in time for Ivan Stenberg to find the defenseman with a well- placed pass.",
